After publish, the knowledge importer reads the published category records as a new native kind through the ADR-062 reader registry and projects each category, its replaced-by links and its membership edges between decisions, criteria and categories into the next Neo4j generation.

The importer reads the proposed category record design and the runtime DecisionRecord. Its output is a new projection generation, but criterion_category is not yet a registered native kind, so the category nodes and membership edges have no defined shape.

